WEBVTT

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.640
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.180
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.720
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:37.800
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:46.210
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:53.550
shining warmly.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:58.350
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:05.360
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:15.500
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:22.850
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.580
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:34.520
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:01:52.310 --> 00:01:57.280
Say it out loud - you love Takehiko Henmi!

00:01:57.510 --> 00:02:00.780
So you admitted this girl, Misonoo Nanako, into the Sorority.

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:04.890
You wanted her to worship you so much that she would leave Henmi!

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:10.860
I, Misonoo Nanako, first year, section B...

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:18.170
...for certain personal reasons, hereby resign from the Sorority.

00:02:20.090 --> 00:02:25.790
<b>26. The Promise in the Snow</b>

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:35.520
What's going on?

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:36.130
What?

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:38.750
You're not speaking to me today? <i> </i>

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:40.190
You're not speaking to me today? It's not like that.

00:02:40.190 --> 00:02:41.790
It IS like that!

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:46.330
I said "good morning" and you just mumbled.

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:47.060
Did I?

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:49.420
What happened?

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:52.900
Last night at the Sorority house!

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:55.270
What happened with Miya-sama?

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:56.570
Listen!!

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:01.240
My brother...

00:03:01.980 --> 00:03:04.210
I can't tell Mariko-san...

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:07.750
...about what happened with Miya-sama.

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:12.720
...or with Saint-Juste-sama.

00:03:12.890 --> 00:03:18.560
Or that I have written a letter of resignation.

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:26.940
Hi, Misonoo-san.

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:30.140
I need to speak to Miya-sama.

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:34.230
She has a cold. She's resting at her summer place.

00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:36.440
...her summer place?

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:41.980
That summer place...

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:45.790
Have you seen Rei, today?

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:48.260
I've been looking for her since yesterday.

00:03:49.090 --> 00:03:50.030
Well, I...

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:52.690
We have an exhibition game tonight.

00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:56.600
I'd asked her to land a hand, but I guess she won't make it.

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:59.800
Could you remind her if you see her?

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:03.300
Tell her it's at the auditorium at 7.

00:04:03.540 --> 00:04:04.240
OK...

00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:05.340
Thanks!

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:10.480
Yes, that's right my Brother.

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:13.880
The one suffering the most from all this,

00:04:13.880 --> 00:04:16.280
...might actually be Saint-Juste-sama.

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:21.290
She, who has eyes only for Miya-sama,

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:24.660
...now knows that Miya-sama is in love with someone else.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:28.400
Saint-Juste-sama.

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:49.880
My mother had just died,

00:04:49.880 --> 00:04:53.120
...and your family was about to adopt me.

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:57.830
Around that time, you took a trip to the north.

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:06.570
You told me that you had a sudden desire to see the snow.

00:05:08.770 --> 00:05:13.380
But I knew perfectly well the real reason for the trip.

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:16.850
Those fiercely proud eyes of yours,

00:05:16.850 --> 00:05:19.380
...they told me the real story.

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:35.830
Long ago, when I was a child...

00:05:35.830 --> 00:05:39.500
...I collected glass miniatures.

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:42.900
Glass has such purity, such clarity...

00:05:43.240 --> 00:05:47.810
Delicate and glowing... I love them!

00:05:51.710 --> 00:05:55.680
But one day one of the maids was cleaning,

00:05:55.680 --> 00:06:00.780
...and carelessly broke one of the pieces I had on the shelf.

00:06:04.890 --> 00:06:08.900
I immediately smashed all the rest!

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:10.670
With my own hands!

00:06:11.130 --> 00:06:12.470
Your own hands?

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:17.570
Yes, I had to. Otherwise, someone might have broken another.

00:06:20.640 --> 00:06:25.810
No one can break or defile the things I cherish.

00:06:26.310 --> 00:06:30.750
They can't. I'll never allow it! It would be unforgivable.

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:34.590
But for us, it's still not too late.

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:40.700
It's not too late to seal our beautiful time forever.

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:43.730
No one will ever desecrate it.

00:06:43.730 --> 00:06:45.600
Do you understand, Rei?

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:47.670
Yes.

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:52.670
I knew you would...

00:06:53.440 --> 00:06:55.640
I understand, completely.

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:58.510
I'll be joining you. Soon.

00:06:58.510 --> 00:07:00.420
Yes. Soon.

00:07:51.930 --> 00:07:53.770
Oh, you're there!

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:56.770
You're there, aren't you, Saint-Juste-sama?

00:07:56.770 --> 00:08:00.610
Hello? I'm coming right over.

00:08:00.610 --> 00:08:02.880
What kind of soup do you want?

00:08:04.150 --> 00:08:09.420
Vegetable? Chicken? My Chinese soup is good, too!

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:14.120
So, my Brother... I thought I'd cook something for her.

00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:18.630
It's the only thing I can do for her.

00:08:18.930 --> 00:08:23.010
If she falls asleep, or won't talk, it's OK.

00:08:23.010 --> 00:08:25.930
Even if she won't so much as smile... it's OK.

00:08:49.420 --> 00:08:52.130
Why is it you are seeing Rei today?

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:54.560
I... thought she'd like some soup...

00:08:54.560 --> 00:08:56.400
That's very nice of you.

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:59.600
But it's not necessary. She doesn't need anything.

00:09:09.010 --> 00:09:12.410
She doesn't need anything. Go on back home.

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:13.780
Miya-sama!

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:22.720
I won't go home! I won't go home!

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:28.930
Didn't you hear me?

00:09:28.930 --> 00:09:32.430
I told you to go home.

00:09:32.770 --> 00:09:34.770
I... here...

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:38.010
It's my resignation.

00:09:41.580 --> 00:09:43.040
I'm crushed..

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:47.380
It hurts that you misunderstood me so!

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:51.350
I'm only exchanging letters with my Brother! That's all!

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:09.200
I'll look in on that girl myself.

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:11.240
Go on now. Back home.

00:10:12.010 --> 00:10:13.880
But I know her!

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:15.840
I know how cold her room is!

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:19.380
How she's always alone, and never eats...

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:23.180
So, I said I'd be with her, go home!

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:28.360
That's not true! You never do anything for Saint-Juste-sama!

00:10:37.630 --> 00:10:39.900
Choose your words with care.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:44.970
I am her sister.

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:50.750
I'm not going home!

00:10:58.390 --> 00:10:59.490
Rei!

00:10:59.990 --> 00:11:01.460
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:11:07.030 --> 00:11:08.730
Saint-Juste-sama!

00:11:29.750 --> 00:11:31.520
I was waiting.

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:36.790
I thought you would join me. I waited for you.

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:59.410
I believed that you would join me soon.

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:03.590
I was there waiting for you.

00:12:08.920 --> 00:12:11.630
The cold of the snow was so comforting.

00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:16.160
As I was losing consciousness,

00:12:16.160 --> 00:12:21.500
...I felt that you were there watching over me.

00:12:26.270 --> 00:12:32.540
The snow's coldness was soon replaced with warmth, softness...

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:36.620
...and I drifted into a flowering springtime.

00:12:36.620 --> 00:12:40.450
Yes, I knew my body temperature was falling,

00:12:40.450 --> 00:12:43.870
...my consciousness began to fade,

00:12:43.890 --> 00:12:46.490
...and I remember nothing more.

00:12:58.140 --> 00:13:01.580
When I woke up, I was in a hospital bed.

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:10.320
And there you were... you were at my bedside.

00:13:13.290 --> 00:13:17.030
You tilted your head and looked at me intently.

00:13:20.060 --> 00:13:23.800
On the other side of the window, it was still snowing.

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:26.900
I can still remember the sound of the falling snow...

00:13:27.540 --> 00:13:34.340
Koto koto... koton koton... koto koto... koton koton...

00:13:37.410 --> 00:13:38.880
Listen here, fellow.

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:43.550
It's an import. So, how about 25,000 yen?

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:47.920
Hey, I'll give you a discount even.

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:51.060
Lets see your wallet... what...?

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:52.860
Huh? What is it?

00:13:52.860 --> 00:13:54.860
This guy is...

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:00.940
Damn! Wait!

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:04.470
Come back here, dammit!

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:06.940
Come back!

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:11.550
You're gonna get it now!

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:38.910
Some time passed, and you came to see me.

00:14:40.080 --> 00:14:43.080
It turned out I wasn't to be living with the family.

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:45.280
Instead, I'd be alone in an apartment.

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:48.850
So you paid me a visit there.

00:14:57.260 --> 00:15:00.130
Here, I'd like to give you this.

00:15:00.430 --> 00:15:03.420
I can't live with you here,

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:07.140
...but take this doll in my place, to remind you.

00:15:07.370 --> 00:15:09.840
And one more thing...

00:15:10.440 --> 00:15:15.380
Someday, I will honor my promise, and try again with you.

00:15:15.710 --> 00:15:18.710
Take this bracelet as a token of my promise.

00:15:19.450 --> 00:15:22.780
Until then, will you wait for me?

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:29.460
Yes, I'll wait.

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:39.530
Stop here.

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:59.350
It's sad, isn't it, how you and I ended up being such wonderful sisters.

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:03.830
And it's so sad that we have different mothers.

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:08.430
The more we come to like each others, the more it disturbs me.

00:16:08.430 --> 00:16:10.130
It's all unforgivable.

00:16:11.730 --> 00:16:16.720
So before sadness overtakes us... before it's too late for us...

00:16:16.720 --> 00:16:18.930
Yes, Fukiko-sama!

00:16:20.440 --> 00:16:22.780
I want to see the snow.

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:32.790
It was you who first said it,

00:16:32.790 --> 00:16:34.420
"Let's just end it all."

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:40.000
But then... after all that... you didn't join me.

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:50.010
Help! Help me, someone!

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:54.840
Someone help me! It's my sister...!

00:17:18.900 --> 00:17:21.350
I've been looking for you, Rei.

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:28.780
You're hurt... because you think I'm in love with someone else.

00:17:30.010 --> 00:17:35.140
But it's not true. There is nothing between him and me.

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:38.090
He means nothing to me.

00:17:38.090 --> 00:17:42.790
You are the only one who matters to me.

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:44.660
Really. Please believe me.

00:17:45.490 --> 00:17:49.430
Lies! Those are all lies!

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:54.600
In the snow when you said "let's die", it wasn't for us.

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:58.770
It was because he hurt you so badly,

00:17:58.770 --> 00:18:01.210
...you had to drag me into your pain!

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:04.450
No! That wasn't it!

00:18:04.450 --> 00:18:08.550
It was only for you and me! No one else!

00:18:08.820 --> 00:18:12.850
I have eyes only for you. You alone!

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:15.760
But I don't want to see you the way you are now.

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:20.200
I have to stay away from you so I don't see how you really are!

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:31.870
I'll show you proof.

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:41.320
This time, I'll go first.

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:44.250
Then you can follow me.

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:52.790
Or... shall we go both at once?

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:56.430
Yes. That would be best.

00:18:57.630 --> 00:18:59.000
This time.

00:19:00.940 --> 00:19:05.710
We'll fly like birds, and in that brief moment,

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:11.210
...I'll trust you a hundred times... a THOUSAND times... more than now.

00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:16.920
Come on...

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:50.550
Let's stop. That's enough.

00:19:52.450 --> 00:19:56.460
It's true. I saw your proof!

00:19:57.830 --> 00:20:00.460
No more! That's enough!

00:20:00.460 --> 00:20:03.230
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:37.600
Welcome home!

00:20:37.600 --> 00:20:42.200
Have some chicken stew, with lots of vegetables.

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:55.180
I looked all over for you. But I knew you'd come back here.

00:20:55.180 --> 00:20:58.710
I thought you would. I was sure of it.

00:20:58.710 --> 00:21:02.220
I thought you'd want something to eat.

00:21:04.260 --> 00:21:06.560
I'll leave now.

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:13.640
Could you die?

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:21.480
If someone you loved asked you to die with them,

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:23.240
...could you do it?

00:21:27.790 --> 00:21:29.770
Could you die?

00:21:31.590 --> 00:21:32.100
I...

00:21:33.690 --> 00:21:38.100
I've never thought about it!

00:21:38.130 --> 00:21:40.810
Absolutely never!

00:21:40.840 --> 00:21:45.320
I couldn't! Never!

00:21:45.330 --> 00:21:48.720
How could I... No!

00:21:48.730 --> 00:21:50.540
That's... No! No, no!

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:52.860
No!

00:21:56.090 --> 00:21:58.550
That's mustn't happen! Don't!

00:21:59.320 --> 00:22:00.690
DON'T DO IT!

00:22:03.190 --> 00:22:04.700
Thank you.

00:22:16.610 --> 00:22:17.720
My dear Brother...

00:22:18.150 --> 00:22:21.780
A week passed, then something else happened.

00:22:22.690 --> 00:22:26.280
Nanako-san, Shinobu-san is here.

00:22:27.660 --> 00:22:30.820
Wow, Mariko-san! Hello!

00:22:32.220 --> 00:22:33.380
I came over!

00:22:33.500 --> 00:22:36.350
I came here to stay overnight.

00:22:36.470 --> 00:22:38.970
Can I stay over, in your room?

00:22:39.330 --> 00:22:42.440
I suppose it's OK, but...

00:22:42.560 --> 00:22:45.630
Oh good... don't worry, just one night, OK?

00:22:45.750 --> 00:22:48.120
Please don't ask me why...

00:22:49.850 --> 00:22:52.150
Well... what about your parents?

00:22:52.170 --> 00:22:55.420
I asked them already. Sorry for the intrusion. Thank you.

00:22:56.380 --> 00:23:01.230
Wow, great! Your bed is softer than mine!

00:23:01.350 --> 00:23:02.740
Really?

00:23:04.170 --> 00:23:05.500
Light out? <i> </i>

00:23:05.520 --> 00:23:06.300
Sure!

00:23:07.290 --> 00:23:09.600
Good night. Good night.

00:23:09.720 --> 00:23:11.040
Sorry I didn't call. <i> </i>

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:12.150
It's OK.

00:23:36.250 --> 00:23:37.530
Mariko-san?

00:23:40.560 --> 00:23:41.660
Mariko-san!

00:23:42.110 --> 00:23:44.370
Nanako-san!

00:23:47.510 --> 00:23:51.110
My brother... It's about Mariko-san. She is...

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:14.360
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:19.830
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:25.440
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:30.910
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.650 --> 00:24:37.190
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.190 --> 00:24:42.660
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.660 --> 00:24:45.390
This is surely a game

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:48.200
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:50.600
Always dancing,

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:55.870
Always capricious...
